- the ribbon labels moved from panes.rs to panes/cmd.rs (#4393), and
  New tool… moved to tool_library_dialog/list_header.rs;
- op-rotary-contour.png and op-rotary-parallel.png drifted from assets/ui/;
- the post reference had no row for manualToolChange (#4085).

Refs #4133

